vernance_registerInitialInitiatives()** - Registers bribeInitiative as initial initiative\\n\\n## Clamping Strategy\\n- **Maximum values**: Used `balanceOf()` and `userStates()` to get maximum available amounts\\n- **Exact values**: Used specific addresses like `address(bribeInitiative)` and current actor\\n- **Empty arrays**: Used `new address[](0)` and `new bytes[](0)` for safe def...\n00081| {\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1763348870335,\"sessionID\":\"ses_57039f04fffebU24XvTTct63C7\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_a8fc855010012Wh5vwzXdqI1Gy\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_57039f04fffebU24XvTTct63C7\",\"messageID\":\"msg_a8fc84c24001gCiSMGNUaUmKQb\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"\\nGreat! The compilation is successful. Now let me create a summary of the clamped handlers I've implemented:\",\"time\":{\"start\":1763348870333,\"end\":1763348870333}}}\n00082| {\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1763348870381,\"sessionID\":\"ses_57039f04fffebU24XvTTct63C7\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_a8fc874be001SI6AehId89906D\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_57039f04fffebU24XvTTct63C7\",\"messageID\":\"msg_a8fc84c24001gCiSMGNUaUmKQb\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"1bda1da2d1f803424704849dea229c09296fc365\",\"cost\":0,\"tokens\":{\"input\":103,\"output\":649,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"read\":24950,\"write\":0}}}}\n00083| {\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1763348872692,\"sessionID\":\"ses_57039f04fffebU24XvTTct63C7\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_a8fc87df1001UcbNtU1X147dfn\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_57039f04fffebU24XvTTct63C7\",\"messageID\":\"msg_a8fc87544001T60K12wpZBKvnj\",\"type\":\"step-start\",\"snapshot\":\"0eacb8bbabb7e3c4889b7f5836a42726de0eb65e\"}}\n00084| {\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1763348874795,\"sessionID\":\"ses_57039f04fffebU24XvTTct63C7\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_a8fc87df30017PJbmL3v8mIS5h\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_57039f04fffebU24XvTTct63C7\",\"messageID\":\"msg_a8fc87544001T60K12wpZBKvnj\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"\\n## Phase 3 Complete ✅\\n\\nSuccessfully imple