{"type":"text","timestamp":1763349107346,"sessionID":"ses_57037758cffeEZXe7lPXSAAVsc","part":{"id":"prt_a8fcc08720016C0a5hEBMEQTjQ","sessionID":"ses_57037758cffeEZXe7lPXSAAVsc","messageID":"msg_a8fcbfec1001rOuUdJMYcQN65q","type":"text","text":"\n## Phase 4 Complete ✅\n\nSuccessfully implemented shortcut handlers for functions requiring 3+ prerequisite function calls:\n\n**4 shortcut handlers created:**\n- `shortcut_governance_claimForInitiative()` - 4 steps → 1 call\n- `shortcut_bribeInitiative_claimBribes()` - 5 steps → 1 call  \n- `shortcut_full_allocation_flow()` - 3 steps → 1 call\n- `shortcut_reset_allocation_flow()` - 3 steps → 1 call\n\nAll shortcuts use clamped functions for maximum success rate and compile successfully. The fuzzer can now reach complex contract states in single function calls instead of discovering multi-step sequences randomly.","time":{"start":1763349107345,"end":1763349107345}}}
